			<i><span class="en">Prud. Ham. 450</span></i>: <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Jērĕmĭās,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juvenc. Ev. Hist. 3, 269</span></i>
			), ae, m., <i>the
